From: Nokcandu presentation integration
Subject: winemac: Relayout remote Metal children with the virtual-screen scale.

Remote CAContext layers do not participate in NSView relayout. Export their
content in Windows pixels and rescale the host targets during the existing
presentation relayout, including native fullscreen transitions. Non-presented
windows keep the upstream point/retina geometry.

